            "text": "{\"results\":[{\"kind\":\"document\",\"owner\":{\"kind\":\"issue\",\"key\":\"CORE-1\",\"title\":\"Navigation instruments\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"issue\":{\"key\":\"CORE-1\",\"title\":\"Navigation instruments\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"artifact\":{\"slug\":\"spec\",\"name\":\"spec.md\"},\"id\":\"38aecbeb-4284-4b5d-8969-b806748d7b5e\",\"snippet\":\"Instruments\\n\\nThe \\u003cmark\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e measures altitude. Every \\u003cmark\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e is brass\",\"rank\":0.01639344262295082,\"href\":\"/issues/CORE-1/spec?q=astrolabe\"},{\"kind\":\"ask\",\"owner\":{\"kind\":\"issue\",\"key\":\"CORE-1\",\"title\":\"Navigation instruments\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"issue\":{\"key\":\"CORE-1\",\"title\":\"Navigation instruments\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"id\":\"ead5c40b-c608-4e67-9d13-f0e705fb0373\",\"snippet\":\"Where does the \\u003cmark\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e live between voyages? On the chart table In the captain\\u0026#39;s cabin Keep the \\u003cmark\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e on the chart table during\",\"rank\":0.01639344262295082,\"href\":\"/issues/CORE-1/asks/ead5c40b-c608-4e67-9d13-f0e705fb0373\",\"ask\":{\"state\":\"answered\",\"answer\":{\"user\":\"alice\",\"selected\":[\"On the chart table\"],\"text\":\"Keep the astrolabe on the chart table during every crossing, and recalibrate its rete against the meridian at local noon whenever the sky is clear enough to take a clean sighting. Log each reading beside the dead-reckoning position in the ship's book, note the observer and the instrument's serial number, and send any drift larger than half a degree to the instrument maker before the next voyage leaves port.\",\"at\":\"2026-11-09T04:24:03.264814Z\"}}},{\"kind\":\"comment\",\"owner\":{\"kind\":\"issue\",\"key\":\"CORE-2\",\"title\":\"Other work\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"issue\":{\"key\":\"CORE-2\",\"title\":\"Other work\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"id\":\"85672436-c19a-404a-8900-c961628436b3\",\"snippet\":\"Move the \\u003cmark\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e diagram\",\"rank\":0.01639344262295082,\"href\":\"/issues/CORE-2/comments/85672436-c19a-404a-8900-c961628436b3\"}],\"total\":3,\"reachable\":3,\"limit\":20,\"offset\":0,\"took_ms\":14,\"degraded\":\"embedder_unavailable\"}\n"
          },
